          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The depositor provided the data file in SAV format. DANS added the .sps and .dat formats.\n\n*An error was noticed in some variables of the NKO 2017 v1.3. For three dichotomous variables (v312-v314), the labelling of the content answers has been switched. \n*In version1.4 the creator modified this by re-encoding the values.\n*In version1.5 the creator made an adjustment to some very small weighing factors (with missing values)."
